So it made me laugh to see a day of like, oh, that was the moment when he decided to go show that he's also an amazing piano player.
所以看到这一幕让我笑出来，心想：哦，这就是他决定去展现自己也是个惊艳的钢琴演奏者的那个时刻。

00:29:43.619 --> 00:29:46.602
I really liked also when Barney was with the way Neil did the reading.
我也很喜欢尼尔（Neil）念台词的那种方式。

