This is because often he's competing with Marshall to be Ted's best friend and always losing.
这是因为他经常与马歇尔竞争成为泰德最好的朋友，而且总是输。

00:30:35.800 --> 00:30:42.346
Barney is the Washington Generals against the Globetrotters of Marshall in that French of competition.
在这场竞争中，巴尼就像是迎战马歇尔这个“哈林环球旅行者队”的华盛顿将军队。

