I would say it's one of Barney's deepest series drives from Pilot on, I just want to know I'm important to Ted.
可以说这是巴尼从第一季开始最深层的驱动力之一：我只想知道我对泰德很重要。

00:31:04.819 --> 00:31:05.819
Yeah.
对。

00:31:05.819 --> 00:31:06.819
Yeah.
对。

