Like he doesn't believe like all rising tide lifts all boats.
就像他不相信“水涨船高”那一套。

00:31:18.299 --> 00:31:19.299
Like he doesn't believe.
就像他不相信。

00:31:19.299 --> 00:31:20.140
Not at all.
一点也不。

00:31:20.140 --> 00:31:27.700
He's like, there's gonna be someone left at the end, triumphant standing atop these corpses, atop this funeral pyre, and it's gonna be me, you know?
他觉得：最后总会有一个人留下来，洋洋得意地站在这些尸体上、站在这个火葬堆上，而那个人会是我，你知道吗？

00:31:27.700 --> 00:31:29.019
Yes, absolutely.
是的，完全如此。

00:31:29.019 --> 00:31:30.779
And hopefully Ted will be with me.
而且希望泰德能跟我在一起。

00:31:30.779 --> 00:31:33.140
