00:33:04.490 --> 00:33:11.970
It is the perfect, were you on Letterman's writing staff when they did top 10 numbers, one through 10?
这简直完美，大卫·莱特曼（Letterman）做1到10的“十大排行榜”时你在他的编剧团队吗？

