But 83% feels to me like, for whatever reason, if you were gonna have a guy who just threw out bullshit statistics all the time, 83% is the perfect number.
但“83%”给我的感觉是，无论出于什么原因，如果你要塑造一个满嘴胡说八道统计数据的家伙，“83%”就是最完美的数字。

00:33:50.529 --> 00:33:53.970
Like 82% is wrong and 84% is wrong.
因为82%不对，84%也不对。

